3. Preinstallation assessment (read-only)
1.	Copy Test-CCPPrerequisites.ps1 to the proposed CCP machine. Open elevated 64-bit Windows PowerShell 5.1.
2.	Run the command below with your approved FQDN and tenant hostname.
3.	Review CSV/TXT report; remediate FAIL findings. Treat WARN and MANUAL as engineering review items, not automatic blockers.
4.	Save the report in the change ticket. Record exceptions, approvals, responsible teams and targeted remediation date.
